          "_name": "team1",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"team1\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Name\" name=\"showName\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Role\" name=\"showRole\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Social\" name=\"showSocial\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Background\" name=\"bgCard\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#efefef\" condition=\"bgCard\">\n        <select title=\"Cards Count\" name=\"countCards\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n        </select> \n        <select title=\"Social Icons\" name=\"socIcons\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n        </select>\n        \n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background5.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.4\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container align-center\">\n        <h2 class=\"pb-3 mbr-fonts-style mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"></h2>\n        <h3 class=\"pb-5 mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mbr-light\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n            Click any icon or text to edit or style it. Click blue \"Gear\" icon in the top right corner to hide/show text and change the block and cards background, icons count and other.\n        </h3>\n        <div class=\"row media-row\" mbr-list mbr-list-grow=\"countCards\">\n            <div class=\"team-item col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"item-image\">\n                    <a href=\"assets/files/Izvestiya-19-June-1959.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/izvestiya-19-june-1959-510x725.jpeg\" alt title></a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-caption py-3\" mbr-if=\"showName || showRole || showSocial\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name px-2\" mbr-if=\"showName\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".item-name\">\"ПОСЛЕ ОГНЕННОГО РЕЙСА\"</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-role px-2\" mbr-if=\"showRole\" data-app-selector=\".item-role\">\n                        <p>Статья в газете \"Известия Советов Депутатов\"&nbsp;<br>19 июля 1959.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-social pt-2\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"p-1 socicon-twitter socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Mobirise/1616226671953247\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>1\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-facebook socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/u/0/+Mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>2\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-googleplus socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>3\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-linkedin socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>4\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-instagram socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt_tncVAetpK5JeM8L-8jyw\" target=\"_blank\">    \n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>5\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-youtube socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        <div class=\"team-item col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"item-image\">\n                    <a href=\"assets/files/KrasnayaZvezda-31-Jan-1958.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/krasnayazvezda-31-jan-1958-510x774.jpg\" alt title></a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-caption py-3\" mbr-if=\"showName || showRole || showSocial\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name px-2\" mbr-if=\"showName\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".item-name\">\"ОГНЕННЫЕ МИЛИ\"</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-role px-2\" mbr-if=\"showRole\" data-app-selector=\".item-role\">\n                        <p>Статья <a href=\"page7.html\" target=\"_blank\">капитана Сергеева</a> в газете \"Красная Звезда \"<br>31 января 1958&nbsp;</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-social pt-2\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"p-1 socicon-twitter socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Mobirise/1616226671953247\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>1\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-facebook socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/u/0/+Mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>2\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-googleplus socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>3\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-linkedin socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>4\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-instagram socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt_tncVAetpK5JeM8L-8jyw\" target=\"_blank\">    \n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>5\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-youtube socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"team-item col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"item-image\">\n                    <a href=\"assets/files/красная звезда № 298 от 27 декабря 1984 года..pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/298-27-1984-.-510x492.jpg\" alt title></a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-caption py-3\" mbr-if=\"showName || showRole || showSocial\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name px-2\" mbr-if=\"showName\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".item-name\">\"ЕГО КРУГОСВЕТНОЕ ПЛАВАНИЕ\"<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-role px-2\" mbr-if=\"showRole\" data-app-selector=\".item-role\">\n                        <p>Статья об <a href=\"page23.html\" target=\"_blank\">Алексее Голубкове</a>\n<br>в газете \"Красная Звезда\"\n<br>27 декабря 1984&nbsp;</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-social pt-2\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"p-1 socicon-twitter socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Mobirise/1616226671953247\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>1\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-facebook socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/u/0/+Mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>2\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-googleplus socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>3\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-linkedin socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>4\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-instagram socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt_tncVAetpK5JeM8L-8jyw\" target=\"_blank\">    \n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>5\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-youtube socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"team-item col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"item-image\">\n                    <a href=\"assets/files/Moryak-22-Nov-2001.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/moryak-22-nov-2003-510x684.jpeg\" alt title></a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-caption py-3\" mbr-if=\"showName || showRole || showSocial\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name px-2\" mbr-if=\"showName\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".item-name\">\"ОГНИ БУХТЫ ПРОВИДЕНИЯ\"</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-role px-2\" mbr-if=\"showRole\" data-app-selector=\".item-role\">\n                        <p>Интервью <a href=\"page13.html\" target=\"_blank\">Юзефа Злотника</a> журналу \"Морякъ\" \n<br>22 ноября 2001&nbsp;</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-social pt-2\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"p-1 socicon-twitter socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Mobirise/1616226671953247\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>1\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-facebook socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/u/0/+Mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>2\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-googleplus socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>3\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-linkedin socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>4\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-instagram socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt_tncVAetpK5JeM8L-8jyw\" target=\"_blank\">    \n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>5\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-youtube socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div></div>    \n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "team1-1am",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise4",
          "_cid": "rOFJGUuwQ2",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#767676"
            },
            ".media-row": {
              "display": "-webkit-flex",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "-webkit-justify-content": "center"
            },
            ".team-item": {
              "transition": "all .2s",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              ".item-image img": {
                "width": "100%"
              },
              ".item-name": {
                "p": {
                  "margin-bottom": "0"
                }
              },
              ".item-role": {
                "p": {
                  "margin-bottom": "0"
                }
              },
              ".item-social": {
                "display": "-webkit-flex",
                "flex-wrap": "wrap",
                "justify-content": "center",
                "-webkit-flex-wrap": "wrap",
                "-webkit-justify-content": "center",
                ".socicon": {
                  "color": "#232323",
                  "font-size": "17px"
                }
              },
              ".item-caption": {
                "& when (@bgCard)": {
                  "background": "@cardColor"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "team1",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"team1\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Name\" name=\"showName\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Role\" name=\"showRole\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Social\" name=\"showSocial\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Background\" name=\"bgCard\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#efefef\" condition=\"bgCard\">\n        <select title=\"Cards Count\" name=\"countCards\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n        </select> \n        <select title=\"Social Icons\" name=\"socIcons\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n        </select>\n        \n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background5.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.4\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container align-center\">\n        <h2 class=\"pb-3 mbr-fonts-style mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"></h2>\n        <h3 class=\"pb-5 mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mbr-light\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n            Click any icon or text to edit or style it. Click blue \"Gear\" icon in the top right corner to hide/show text and change the block and cards background, icons count and other.\n        </h3>\n        <div class=\"row media-row\" mbr-list mbr-list-grow=\"countCards\">\n            <div class=\"team-item col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"item-image\">\n                    <a href=\"assets/files/SovetskayaAbhazia -23-Jan-1982.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/sovetskayaabhazia-23-jan-1982-510x247.jpg\" alt title></a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-caption py-3\" mbr-if=\"showName || showRole || showSocial\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name px-2\" mbr-if=\"showName\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".item-name\">\"ПО ЗАДАНИЮ СТАВКИ\"</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-role px-2\" mbr-if=\"showRole\" data-app-selector=\".item-role\">\n                        <p>Статья в газете \"Советская Абхазия\" \n<br>23 января 1982</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-social pt-2\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"p-1 socicon-twitter socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Mobirise/1616226671953247\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>1\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-facebook socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/u/0/+Mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>2\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-googleplus socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>3\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-linkedin socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>4\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-instagram socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt_tncVAetpK5JeM8L-8jyw\" target=\"_blank\">    \n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>5\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-youtube socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        <div class=\"team-item col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"item-image\">\n                    <a href=\"assets/files/Pravda-21-Dec-1971.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/pravda-21-dec-1971-510x291.jpg\" alt title></a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-caption py-3\" mbr-if=\"showName || showRole || showSocial\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name px-2\" mbr-if=\"showName\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".item-name\">\"ЛЕДОКОЛ ПРИНИМАЕТ БОЙ\"</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-role px-2\" mbr-if=\"showRole\" data-app-selector=\".item-role\">\n                        <p>Статья Э.Безуглова в \"Правде\" 21 декабря 1971&nbsp;</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-social pt-2\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"p-1 socicon-twitter socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Mobirise/1616226671953247\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>1\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-facebook socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/u/0/+Mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>2\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-googleplus socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>3\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-linkedin socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>4\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-instagram socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt_tncVAetpK5JeM8L-8jyw\" target=\"_blank\">    \n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>5\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-youtube socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"team-item col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"item-image\">\n                    <a href=\"assets/files/Novgorodskie%20Vedomosti%20-%2011%20feb%202000_.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/clipboard04-510x608.jpg\" alt title></a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-caption py-3\" mbr-if=\"showName || showRole || showSocial\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name px-2\" mbr-if=\"showName\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".item-name\">\"ХОЖДЕНИЕ ЗА ЧЕТЫРЕ ОКЕАНА\"</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-role px-2\" mbr-if=\"showRole\" data-app-selector=\".item-role\">\n                        <p>Статья, написанная по интервью<a href=\"page27.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Александра Лебедева</a>.<br>\"Новгородские Ведомости\"<br>11 февраля 2000</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-social pt-2\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"p-1 socicon-twitter socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Mobirise/1616226671953247\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>1\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-facebook socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/u/0/+Mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>2\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-googleplus socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>3\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-linkedin socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>4\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-instagram socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt_tncVAetpK5JeM8L-8jyw\" target=\"_blank\">    \n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>5\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-youtube socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"team-item col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"item-image\">\n                    <a href=\"assets/files/Levsha - 09-2005.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/01-510x721.jpg\" alt title></a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-caption py-3\" mbr-if=\"showName || showRole || showSocial\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name px-2\" mbr-if=\"showName\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".item-name\">\"ЭКСПЕДИЦИЯ ЭОН-18\"<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-role px-2\" mbr-if=\"showRole\" data-app-selector=\".item-role\">\n                        <p>статья о кругосветке \"Микояна\" с моделью для сборки коробля в журнале \"Левша\" за сентябрь 2005 года</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-social pt-2\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"p-1 socicon-twitter socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Mobirise/1616226671953247\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>1\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-facebook socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/u/0/+Mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>2\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-googleplus socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>3\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-linkedin socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>4\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-instagram socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt_tncVAetpK5JeM8L-8jyw\" target=\"_blank\">    \n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>5\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-youtube socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div></div>    \n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "team1-1at",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise4",
          "_cid": "rOIorT8lCh",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#767676"
            },
            ".media-row": {
              "display": "-webkit-flex",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "-webkit-justify-content": "center"
            },
            ".team-item": {
              "transition": "all .2s",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              ".item-image img": {
                "width": "100%"
              },
              ".item-name": {
                "p": {
                  "margin-bottom": "0"
                }
              },
              ".item-role": {
                "p": {
                  "margin-bottom": "0"
                }
              },
              ".item-social": {
                "display": "-webkit-flex",
                "flex-wrap": "wrap",
                "justify-content": "center",
                "-webkit-flex-wrap": "wrap",
                "-webkit-justify-content": "center",
                ".socicon": {
                  "color": "#232323",
                  "font-size": "17px"
                }
              },
              ".item-caption": {
                "& when (@bgCard)": {
                  "background": "@cardColor"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "team1",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"team1\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Name\" name=\"showName\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Role\" name=\"showRole\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Social\" name=\"showSocial\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Background\" name=\"bgCard\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#efefef\" condition=\"bgCard\">\n        <select title=\"Cards Count\" name=\"countCards\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n        </select> \n        <select title=\"Social Icons\" name=\"socIcons\">\n            <option value=\"1\" selected>1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n        </select>\n        \n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background5.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.4\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container align-center\">\n        <h2 class=\"pb-3 mbr-fonts-style mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"></h2>\n        <h3 class=\"pb-5 mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mbr-light\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n            Click any icon or text to edit or style it. Click blue \"Gear\" icon in the top right corner to hide/show text and change the block and cards background, icons count and other.\n        </h3>\n        <div class=\"row media-row\" mbr-list mbr-list-grow=\"countCards\">\n            <div class=\"team-item col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"item-image\">\n                    <a href=\"assets/files/glinkovskij-vestnik-%202018.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/clipboard03-510x621.jpg\" alt title></a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-caption py-3\" mbr-if=\"showName || showRole || showSocial\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name px-2\" mbr-if=\"showName\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".item-name\">\"БОЕВЫЕ ПОХОДЫ НИКОЛАЯ ХОЛИНА\"</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-role px-2\" mbr-if=\"showRole\" data-app-selector=\".item-role\">\n                        <p>Николай Козлов,<br>Газета \"Глинковский Вестник\"<br>14 и 21 сентября 2018</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-social pt-2\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"p-1 socicon-twitter socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Mobirise/1616226671953247\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>1\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-facebook socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/u/0/+Mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>2\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-googleplus socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>3\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-linkedin socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>4\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-instagram socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt_tncVAetpK5JeM8L-8jyw\" target=\"_blank\">    \n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>5\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-youtube socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        <div class=\"team-item col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"item-image\">\n                    <a href=\"assets/files/Groysman.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/clipboard05-510x624.jpg\" alt title></a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-caption py-3\" mbr-if=\"showName || showRole || showSocial\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name px-2\" mbr-if=\"showName\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".item-name\">\"ЗАГОВОРЕННЫЙ КРЕЙСЕР \"МИКОЯН\"</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-role px-2\" mbr-if=\"showRole\" data-app-selector=\".item-role\">\n                        <p>Анна Лукьянчикова<br>Журнал \"Город\"&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;№2(33), май 2010<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-social pt-2\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"p-1 socicon-twitter socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Mobirise/1616226671953247\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>1\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-facebook socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/u/0/+Mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>2\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-googleplus socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>3\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-linkedin socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>4\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-instagram socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt_tncVAetpK5JeM8L-8jyw\" target=\"_blank\">    \n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>5\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-youtube socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"team-item col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"item-image\">\n                    <a href=\"assets/files/%D0%A4%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B3%20%D0%A0%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%8B%20-%2013%20%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BA%202019%20-%20%D0%A1%D1%83%D0%B4%D1%8C%D0%B1%D0%B0%20%D0%9C%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%8F%D0%BA%D0%B0.pdf\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/2-510x664.jpeg\" alt title></a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-caption py-3\" mbr-if=\"showName || showRole || showSocial\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name px-2\" mbr-if=\"showName\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".item-name\">\"СУДЬБА МОРЯКА\"</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-role px-2\" mbr-if=\"showRole\" data-app-selector=\".item-role\">\n                        <p>Николай Козлов<br>Газета \"Флаг Родины\"<br>13 декабря 2019</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-social pt-2\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"p-1 socicon-twitter socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Mobirise/1616226671953247\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>1\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-facebook socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/u/0/+Mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>2\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-googleplus socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>3\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-linkedin socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>4\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-instagram socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt_tncVAetpK5JeM8L-8jyw\" target=\"_blank\">    \n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>5\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-youtube socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"team-item col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"item-image\">\n                    <a href=\"assets/files/Безуглов - По заданию ставки - 1976.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/1-img738-510x615.jpeg\" alt title></a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-caption py-3\" mbr-if=\"showName || showRole || showSocial\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name px-2\" mbr-if=\"showName\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".item-name\">\"ПО ЗАДАНИЮ СТАВКИ\"</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-role px-2\" mbr-if=\"showRole\" data-app-selector=\".item-role\">\n                        <p>Эдуард Безуглов.<br>Статья из книги <br>\"Корабли Герои\"<br>1976</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-social pt-2\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"p-1 socicon-twitter socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/Mobirise/1616226671953247\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>1\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-facebook socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/u/0/+Mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>2\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-googleplus socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>3\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-linkedin socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>4\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-instagram socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCt_tncVAetpK5JeM8L-8jyw\" target=\"_blank\">    \n                            <span mbr-if=\"socIcons>5\" mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"p-1 socicon-youtube socicon mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-social\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div></div>    \n    </div>\n</section>",
